  "text": "This AI tool translates confusing client feedback into actionable design steps. Decoding rambling client voice notes and contradictory Slack messages wastes hours of billable creative time. Scope creep explodes when ambiguous revision requests lack defined acceptance criteria before you touch the file. Feeding raw client remarks into ChatGPT-4o creates an itemized revision checklist mapped directly to Figma design components. You finish client edits on the first try.",
